Uyakudzilitela phansi tibondza takaMowabi
letiphakeme naletitinqaba, atihhihlitele phansi;
uyakutihhihlitela phansi elutfulini.

30:
Uyawukhuluma sewulele phansi sengikwehlisile;
inkhulumo yakho kuyawuba kuvungama nje kwaselutfulini.
Liphimbo lakho liyawuvakala njengelesipoko emhlabatsini;
livi lakho liyawuvumbuka livela elutfulini.

Ngako-ke naku lokushiwo nguSimakadze lowahlenga Abrahama, macondzana nendlu yakaJakobe Simakadze utsi:
“Jakobe akasayikuba nemahloni;
nebuso babo abusayikuphaphatseka.

31:
Naku lokushiwo yiNkhosi Simakadze, Longcwele waka-Israyeli, utsi:
“Ekuphendvukeni nasekuphumuleni
ngulapho kunensindziso yenu khona;
ekuthuleni nasekwetsembeni
ngulapho kunemandla enu khona;
kodvwa ningeke nitsandze lutfo lwako.

34:
Buka la, emadvodza akubo lanesibindzi
akhala kakhulu ngephandle;
emancusa ekuthula akhala kabuhlungu.

Tive tiyakushiswa kube shangatsi ngumcakaco;
njengetihlahla temanyeva letigawuliwe,
tiyawulunyekwa ngemlilo.”

Buka iSiyoni, lidolobha lemadzili etfu;
emehlo akho ayakuyibona iJerusalema,
indzawo yekuhlala lenekuthula,
nelithende lelingeke lisuswe;
tikhonkhwane talo tingeke tisishulwe,
kungeke kudzabuke ngisho nayinye yetindophi talo.

35:
Lababulewe bawo bayawulahlwa ngephandle,
tidvumbu tawo tiyawunuka luboti;
tintsaba tiyawucwila engatini yawo.

41:
Inkhatimulo yaSimakadze iyakwembulwa,
nalo lonkhe luntfu luyakuyibona;
ngobe umlomo waSimakadze sewukhulumile.”

42:
“Bonkhe labakubhavumulelako,
impela, bayakudliwa ngemahloni, bahlazeke;
labo labemelene nawe bayawuba lite, babhubhe baphele.

Bukani la, bonkhe balite!
Tento tabo tilite;
titfombe tabo tingumoya nesiphitsiphitsi.”

43:
Umhlanga lofecekile ngeke awephule;
intsambo yesibane lebhunyako ngeke ayicime.
Ngekwetsembeka kwakhe uyawuletsa umtsetfocotfo,

Buka la, tintfo takucala setentakele,
sengimemetela tintfo letinsha;
tisengakacali kubonakala ebaleni, senginatisa tona.”

44:
Ungesabi, ngobe nginawe;
bantfwabakho ngitabaletsa kusuka emphumalanga,
ngikubutse wena kusukela enshonalanga.

Asibuyekete loko lese kwentekile,
ase sikhulumisane ngalendzaba;
beka indzaba yakho yekuba msulwa kwakho.

45:
Umuntfu ukusebentisa ekubaseni umlilo;
lokunye kwako akutsatse atifutfumete ngako,
ubasa umlilo apheke sinkhwa.
Kodvwa uphindze abate nkulunkulu wakhe,
bese uyamkhonta;
wenta sithico, bese ukhotsama kuso.

Incenye yaleso sigodvo usibasa emlilweni,
alungise kudla kwakhe kulowo mlilo;
wosa inyama yakhe kuwo, ayidle, esutse.
Uphindze otse kuwo, atsi:
“Inhhi! Sengifutfumele;
ngibona umlilo.”

46:
“Nisani kulunga, nine mazulu lasetulu;
emafu akakutfululele phansi.
Umhlaba awuvuleke kabanti,
insindziso ayihlume,
kulunga akukhule nayo;
mine, Simakadze, ngikudalile.

Bonkhe babumbi betithico
bayawuhlaziswa, bahlazeke;
bayawulahlwa badliwe ngemahloni kanyekanye.

49:
Bukani la, nginicolisisile,
noko hhayi njengesiliva;
nginivivinyile ngemlilo wetinhlupheko.

Tandla tami tatibeka tisekelo temhlaba.
Sandla sami sangesekudla sawendlala emazulu;
nangikubita, kuyavela konkhe kanyekanye.

Abazange sebome ngesikhatsi abahola ehlane;
wabavulela emanti agobhota edvwaleni,
wacheketa lidvwala, kwampompota emanti.

50:
Buka la;
ngikucophe entsendzeni yetandla tami;
tibondza takho tisembikwami njalo.

52:
Labo labatiboshwa batawukhululwa masinyane;
bangeke bafele kulomgodzi welijele labo,
futsi bangeke bakweswele kudla.

55:
Nakukhona lokuhlaselako,
kuyawube kungaveli kimi;
nome ngubani lokuhlaselako uyawutinikela kuwe.

62:
Esikhundleni selihlazo lenu,
nine bantfu bami,
niyawuphiwa ngalokuphindziwe;
esikhundleni sekuhlazeka niyawujabula efeni lenu;
ngako niyawudla lifa ngalokuphindziwe eveni lenu,
kujabula kwaphakadze kuyawuba kwenu.

64:
“Nginyatsele sikhamo seliwayini ngingedvwa;
kuto tonkhe tive kute namunye labekanye nami.
Ngibagcobagcobile ngentfukutselo yami,
ngabapitjita ngelulaka lwami.
Ingati yabo yasaphatela tembatfo tami;
ngatingcolisa tonkhe timphahla tami.

Ngobe lilanga lekuphindzisela
belisenhlitiyweni yami;
nemnyaka wekuhlenga labangebami sewufikile.

Ngagcobagcoba tive ngentfukutselo yami;
ngelulaka lwami ngatenta tadzakwa,
ngatfululela ingati yato emhlabatsini.”

Tsine sibakho kusukela kadzenidzeni;
kodvwa shangatsi wena awukabusi etikwetfu,
asikaze sabitwa ngeLibito lakho.

67:
Ngobe uyakwehlulela bonkhe bantfu
ngemlilo nangenkemba;
labo lababulewe nguSimakadze bayawuba banyenti.

6:
Baphrofethi bangumoya nje,
kute nelivi kubo;
ngako akwenteke kubo loko labakushoko.”

Tindlu tabo tigcwele emacebo
njengetindlu tetinyoni letigcwele tinyoni;
sebaze banjinga baba nemandla,

9:
Njengobe bantfu bami bayabhujiswa,
nami ngiyabhujiswa;
ngiyalila, nekwesaba kuyangintfonya.

10:
Abefike masinyane, batesikhihlela sililo,
emehlo etfu adzimate aphophote tinyembeti;
kugobhote imifula yemanti etinkhopheni tetfu.

11:
Lithende lami libhidlitiwe;
tonkhe tindophi talo tidzabukile.
Emadvodzana ami esukile kimi, akasekho;
kute namunye losasele nyalo,
kute longangimisela lelithende lami,
nome-ke angimisele lelidlangala lami.

13:
“Ngiyakuyilahla indlu yami, ngilishiye lifa lami;
ngiyawunikela lowo lengimtsandzako
etandleni tetitsa takhe.

22:
awu, wenandlu yakaDavide, naku lokushiwo nguSimakadze, utsi:
“ ‘Sebentisani umtsetfocotfo njalo nje ekuseni;
nimephule esandleni semcindzeteli lowo lodlelelwe;
ngaphandle kwaloko intfukutselo yami itawuvuka
ivutse njengemlilo ngenca yebubi lenibentile,
yebo, ivutse kubete nalongayicima.

32:
Naku lokushiwo nguSimakadze, utsi:
“Sive lesisindze enkembeni siyawuzuza umusa ehlane;
ngiyawuta ngitewuletsa kuphumula ka-Israyeli.”

51:
“Balekani niphume eBhabhulona;
lishiyeni lelive lemaBhabhulona,
nibe njengetiphongo letihola umhlambi.

Bahlome ngebutjoki nangetikhali;
bavutsa lulaka, abanamusa.
Bevakala njengekudvuma kwelwandle
sebagibele emahhashini abo;
beta ngeticheme temabutfo emphi,
bete kutawuhlasela wena, Ndvodzakati yaseBhabhulona.

Umhlaba uyawutfutfumela ngemsindvo
wekutfunjwa kweBhabhulona;
kukhala kwayo kuyawuhokoma emkhatsini wetive.

3:
“Labasha nalabadzala kulale lunja kanyekanye
elutfulini lwetitaladi;
emajaha ami netintfombi tami kuwe ngelusiko lwenkemba.
Ubabhubhisile ngelilanga lentfukutselo yakho;
ubabulale ngenkemba ungenasihawu nabo.

4:
Indlela yami uyivale ngetinguzanguza tematje;
wagwegwisa indlela yami,
yaba matombetombe.

6:
Injabulo iphelile etinhlitiyweni tetfu;
kugidza kwetfu kwenjabulo
sekugucuke kwaba sililo.

Awu! Simakadze, sibuyisele kuwe,
kuze natsi sitewubuyela kuwe;
sivusetele emalanga etfu abe njengemalanga asendvulo.

25:
Tjela lendlu lehlubukako nankhu umzekeliso, utsi: ‘Naku lokushiwo yiNkhosi Simakadze, itsi:
“ ‘Beka etiko lelibhodo lekupheka;
libeke etiko, bese utsela emanti ekhatsi kulo.

Ngako fumbela tinkhuni, ulumeke umlilo.
Yipheke kahle lenyama, uyihlanganise netinandzisi;
nalamatsambo adzimate ashe.

Liyikhinyabete yonkhe imitamo;
tincwencwe talo letinkhulu atikesuswa
ngisho nangemlilo.

27:
Manje asayatfutfumela emave langaselwandle
ngelilanga lekuwa kwakho;
tichingi taselwandle tiyesaba ngekubhubha kwakho.’

28:
Indzawo yakho yekubusa yayisetilwandle letijulile;
bakhi bakho benta buhle bakho baphelela,
waba ngumkhumbi lomuhle.

31:
Ngiyawulumeka umlilo eGibhithe;
iPhelusiyumi iyawujilajileka ngenca yebuhlungu.
IThebesi iyawuhlaselwa ifohlwe;
iMemfisi iyawukhukhulwa.

3:
Ngako nyalo sengitabungcunula lobubheva bakhe,
embikwemashende akhe abuka;
kute lotamephula lapha etandleni tami.

“Emabito aboBhali
ngiyakuwesusa emlonyweni wakhe;
nemabito abo angeke asacelelwa lusito.

“Ngalelo langa ngiyawuphendvula,” kusho Simakadze,
“ngiyawuphendvula emazulu,
nawo ayawuphendvula umhlaba;

5:
Lokukhona ticalekiso kuphela,
nekucala emanga, nekugwazana,
nekweba kanye nebuphingi;
bephula tonkhe tikhonkhwane teminyele letibekiwe;
kucitsa ingati kulandzela kucitfwa kwengati.

Nome ngabe tinatfo tabo setiphelile,
bayachubeka nebugwadla babo;
baholi babo batitsandza kakhulu tindlela tabo telihlazo.

6:
Kutigcabha kwema-Israyeli kubufakazi
lobumelene nawo;
ema-Israyeli, ngisho na-Efrayimu,
bayakhubateka esonweni sabo;
ngisho naJuda ukhubateka kanye nabo.

10:
Awu, Israyeli, ungajabuli;
ungatsakasi njengaletinye tive.
Ngobe nine aniketsembeki kuNkulunkulu wenu.
Nitsandza inkhokhelo yebugwadla bekukhonta tithico;
nifuna kukhokhelwa kuwo onkhe emabala ekubhulela kolo.

Emabala ekubhulela kolo
nematje ekuhluta liwayini ngeke abondle bantfu;
liwayini lelisha bangeke balitfole.

Bangeke basale eveni laSimakadze;
Efrayimu uyawubuyela eGibhithe,
adle kudla lokungcolile e-Asiriya.

Nkulunkulu wami uyawubala,
ngobe abakamlaleli yena;
bayawuba ngimizulane emkhatsini wetive.

11:
Ngitimisele kutsi ngitabajezisa;
tive titawubutsana timelane nabo,
tibabophe ngenca yetono tabo letinyenti.

12:
Ngimi lowacatfulisa Efrayimu,
ngamtsatsa ngambamba ngemikhono;
kodvwa akazange akunake kutsi ngimi lowamphilisa.

13:
Jakobe wabalekela eveni lase-Aramu;
Israyeli wasebentela kutfola umfati,
ngekwelusa timvu.

14:
Ngatsi nangibondla emadlelweni lamahle, besutsa;
batsi kube besutse, base bayatigabatisa,
base bayangikhohlwa.

15:
Ngiyawufanana nematolo ku-Israyeli;
uyawuchakaza njengembali.
Njengemsedari waseLebanoni
uyawutishonisa phansi timphandze takhe;

2:
“Kodvwa eNtsabeni iSiyoni kuyawuba nenkhululeko;
kuyawuba yindzawo lengcwele.
Umndeni wakaJakobe uyawulidla lelive lekulifa lawo.

3:
Wangijikijela ekujuleni,
enhlitiyweni yetilwandle, emanti angitungeleta;
onkhe emagagasi nemanti endlula etikwami.

2:
Letintsaba titawuncibilika
ngaphansi kwetinyawo takhe;
yebo, tincibilike njengemafutsa nakafakwa emlilweni.
Tiyawugeletela etigodzini nasetihosheni;
yebo, tigelete njengemanti ahhuhluleka
aphuma eticongweni temagcuma.

4:
Lalelani, nine baholi baka-Israyeli!
Bekufanele ngabe ninakekela kutsi esiveni sakini
konkhe kwentiwe ngendlela lefanele;

IKushe neGibhithe
bekungemandla ayo lamakhulu;
iPhuthi neLibhiya, bangani bayo.

3:
Wakhe luzungu lwekubhubhisa tive letinyenti,
wahlazisa indlu yakho;
walahlekelwa nakuphila kwakho.

4:
“Tinsizi temadzili labekiwe
ngiyakutisusa kuwe;
tingumtfwalo nelihlazo kuwe.

10:
IThire yona seyitakhele inqaba;
seyicokelele isiliva kwaba shangatsi lutfuli,
negolide njengeludzaka lwasesitaladini.

11:
“Ngiyawubakhweba ngibabutse bangene.
Ngempela ngiyawubahlenga;
bayawuba banyenti njengakucala.

12:
Awu, sihlahla sesipheshula, khala,
ngobe umsedari sewuwile;
tihlahla letikhulu letinesitfunti setibhujisiwe!
Lilani, ma-okhi aseBhashani;
lihlatsi lebelenile seligecwe lonkhe!

14:
Simakadze utsi: “Eveni lonkhe
tincenye letimbili kulokutsatfu kuyawushaywa kubhujiswe;
noko incenye yesitsatfu iyawusala kulo.

13:
Umhlanga lofecekile angeke awephule;
intsambo yesibane lebhunyako angeke ayicime,
adzimate aphelelise kwehlulela.

14:
Kugcwaliseka kubo siprofetho sa-Isaya lesitsi:
“ ‘Ngekuva niyakuva, ningete nacondza;
ngekubuka niyawubuka, ningete nabona.

9:
Kubhaliwe kutsi:
“Ngenca yakho sibasengotini yekufa lonkhe lilanga;
sitsatfwa njengetimvu tekuhlatjwa.”

14:
Lutsandvo alusoze luphele;
kepha nome kukhona kuphrofetha,
kuyawuphela;
nome kukhona tilimi, tiyawuphela;
nome kukhona lwati, luyawuphela.

2:
Yona iyinhloko yemtimba wayo, libandla;
ngiyo lesicalo, nelitubulo kulabafile,
kuze kutsi kuko konkhe ibe yekucala.

6:
Ngako-ke naKhristu akatitsatselanga lesikhundla sekuba ngumPhristi Lomkhulu; kodvwa wamiswa nguNkulunkulu lowatsi kuye:
“Wena uyiNdvodzana yami;
lamuhla ngikutele.”

11:
Ngase ngitsi: ‘Naku, ngilapha!
Ngitekwenta intsandvo yakho, Nkulunkulu;
njengobe kubhaliwe ngami emculwini.’ ”

2:
Ngobe umBhalo utsi:
“Wonkhe umuntfu ufanana netjani;
nebukhosi bakhe bunjengembali yesiganga;
tjani buyabuna,
nembali yabo iyahhohloka.

20:
Emvakwaloko ngeva shangatsi livi lelikhulu lesicumbi lesikhulu sihlabela ezulwini sitsi:
“Haleluya! Insindziso, nenkhatimulo,
nemandla kwaNkulunkulu wetfu;
